Engineering Workflow > CI Health incidents {#broken-master} > Merging while an incident is open {#merging-during-broken-master}
If your pipeline fails only because of an open CI Health incident, wait for the fix rather than working around it. Merge trains build on top of the default branch, so an unrelated merge can add new failures and make the incident harder to track down. Don't bypass the failure unless the situation is urgent.
When the situation is urgent, there is an exception.

